WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.060
Good morning, John.

2
00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.040
How are you today?

3
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.960
Good morning, Maria.

4
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.200
I’m fine, thank you.

5
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.380
How are you?

6
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.560
I’m good, thanks.

7
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:26.050
Did you sleep well last night?

8
00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.970
Yes, I did.

9
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:29.570
It was quiet.

10
00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.870
What about you?

11
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.290
I slept okay.

12
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.850
But my little boy woke up early.

13
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.470
Oh, I see.

14
00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.610
Children always have a lot of energy!

15
00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.080
That’s true.

16
00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.580
Are you going to work now?

17
00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:47.880
Yes, I am.

18
00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.060
I start at 9 o'clock.

19
00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.740
And you?

20
00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.790
I don’t work today.

21
00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.610
I’m going to the supermarket.

22
00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.020
That’s nice.

23
00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:02.210
Do you need anything special?

24
00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:06.880
Yes, I need bread, milk, and some fruit.

25
00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.130
I also need bread.

26
00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:12.710
Maybe I will go to the shop after work.

27
00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:17.060
The bakery on Main Street has very good bread.

28
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.810
Oh, thank you for telling me.

29
00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:21.730
I will try it.

30
00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:23.650
You’re welcome.

31
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:27.960
By the way, did you see the new family in our building?

32
00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.370
Yes, I saw them yesterday.

33
00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.230
They have a little girl.

34
00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.490
Yes, I met them.

35
00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:37.050
They are very friendly.

36
00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:38.390
That’s nice.

37
00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:41.970
It’s always good to have friendly neighbors.

38
00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.450
I agree.

39
00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:45.690
Well, I should go now.

40
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.990
Have a good day at work!

41
00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:49.530
Thank you.

42
00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.580
See you later.
